UnitPaymentHubWithdraw
└── when a merchant withdraws
    ├── given a credited balance
    │   └── it zeroes the credit, pays the merchant and emits Withdrawn
    ├── given a second withdrawal
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_ZeroAmount
    ├── given nothing credited
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_ZeroAmount
    └── given credits in two tokens
        └── it pays only the requested token
